WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.632 --> 00:00:18.096
"My favorite food is cranberry sauce," Izzie said.

2
00:00:19.857 --> 00:00:22.037
It was the day before Thanksgiving vacation.

3
00:00:23.018 --> 00:00:24.978
Everyone was excited about the holiday.

4
00:00:24.998 --> 00:00:28.259
"I like sweet potatoes," Ethan said.

5
00:00:28.279 --> 00:00:29.880
"Where's Bobby?"

6
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.260
Miss Shelly asked.

7
00:00:32.944 --> 00:00:33.804
Ethan shrugged.

8
00:00:33.824 --> 00:00:36.185
"His mom picked him up early today.

9
00:00:36.906 --> 00:00:38.626
I think he had a doctor's appointment."

10
00:00:39.947 --> 00:00:41.748
"Oh," Miss Shelly said.

11
00:00:41.768 --> 00:00:44.909
"I didn't get to wish him a Happy Thanksgiving."

12
00:00:44.929 --> 00:00:49.211
"Did someone say Thanksgiving?"

13
00:00:49.971 --> 00:00:51.392
Bobby hurried into the gym.

14
00:00:52.572 --> 00:00:55.193
He was carrying a plastic container and a basketball.

15
00:00:55.213 --> 00:00:59.355
"Ethan said you left school early," Izzie said.

16
00:00:59.375 --> 00:01:01.736
"I did," Bobby said.

17
00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.401
"But I didn't want to miss Kids Central today.

18
00:01:06.302 --> 00:01:08.983
It's the last one before Thanksgiving vacation."

19
00:01:10.224 --> 00:01:11.405
Jason stared at him.

20
00:01:11.425 --> 00:01:13.146
"You look different."

21
00:01:14.766 --> 00:01:18.048
Bobby grinned and started dribbling the basketball across the gym.

22
00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:19.809
He jumped up.

23
00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:24.111
Whoosh! The ball sailed through the hoop.

24
00:01:25.432 --> 00:01:26.213
Nina laughed.

25
00:01:26.973 --> 00:01:29.514
"I know what's different!"

26
00:01:29.534 --> 00:01:31.375
"Me too!"

27
00:01:31.716 --> 00:01:32.296
Izzie said.

28
00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:35.061
"You got your cast off, Bobby!"

29
00:01:41.245 --> 00:01:42.165
Miss Shelly said.

30
00:01:42.185 --> 00:01:46.728
"Thanks." Bobby picked up the plastic container.

31
00:01:46.748 --> 00:01:49.809
"I made something to thank you guys."

32
00:01:49.829 --> 00:01:52.051
"Huh?" Jason said.

33
00:01:52.071 --> 00:01:53.692
"What did we do?"

34
00:01:53.712 --> 00:01:58.334
"You made having a broken leg more fun," Bobby said.

35
00:01:58.354 --> 00:02:00.215
"We did?"

36
00:02:00.675 --> 00:02:01.396
Izzie asked.

37
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.100
Bobby nodded.

38
00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.901
"Missing soccer season was terrible.

39
00:02:06.941 --> 00:02:09.042
But you guys helped me and we had fun."

40
00:02:10.242 --> 00:02:11.382
He opened the container.

41
00:02:11.402 --> 00:02:15.203
"See? Thanksgiving cookies.

42
00:02:16.144 --> 00:02:19.045
They're shaped like turkeys, but don't worry.

43
00:02:19.365 --> 00:02:20.845
They taste like chocolate."

44
00:02:22.005 --> 00:02:24.606
"They look delicious," Miss Shelly said.

45
00:02:24.626 --> 00:02:27.367
"They'll go great with our activity today."

46
00:02:27.387 --> 00:02:30.688
"What are we making?"

47
00:02:31.108 --> 00:02:31.908
Jason asked.

48
00:02:32.664 --> 00:02:35.445
"Thankful pumpkin pies," Miss Shelly said.

49
00:02:35.465 --> 00:02:39.307
"Don't you mean Thanksgiving pumpkin pies?"

50
00:02:39.747 --> 00:02:40.507
Izzie asked.

51
00:02:41.328 --> 00:02:46.910
"Nope." Miss Shelly had a stack of paper plates, paint, markers, and pots of glitter.

52
00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:49.371
The kids gathered around the table.

53
00:02:49.391 --> 00:02:53.313
"These pies aren't for eating," Miss Shelly explained.

54
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:56.574
"They're a fun way to share what you're thankful for."

55
00:02:56.594 --> 00:02:58.995
"Oh, I get it."

56
00:02:59.535 --> 00:03:00.676
Nina read from the board.

57
00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:07.264
"Step one: Paint the inside circle of a paper plate orange.

58
00:03:08.826 --> 00:03:10.307
That's for the pie filling.

59
00:03:11.828 --> 00:03:15.611
Then paint the outside edge tan for the piecrust."

60
00:03:17.113 --> 00:03:20.515
"Step two: Stick three cotton balls to the paint."

61
00:03:22.097 --> 00:03:22.917
Bobby laughed.

62
00:03:24.799 --> 00:03:28.802
"Cool! That will look like whipped cream on top of the pumpkin filling."

63
00:03:29.703 --> 00:03:34.883
"Step three: Sprinkle with glitter to look like spices and sugar," Ethan said.

64
00:03:36.805 --> 00:03:38.166
Everyone painted their plates.

65
00:03:38.186 --> 00:03:43.410
"Let's have Bobby's cookies while the paint dries," Miss Shelly said.

66
00:03:46.953 --> 00:03:48.635
Soon Izzie ran to the pies.

67
00:03:48.655 --> 00:03:50.556
"The paint's dry!"

68
00:03:51.457 --> 00:03:52.598
Nina looked at the board.

69
00:03:52.618 --> 00:04:02.873
"Step five: use letter stickers to spell, 'I'm Thankful For And then cut out a slice of pie

70
00:04:02.933 --> 00:04:03.713
with scissors."

71
00:04:06.694 --> 00:04:08.914
"Step six," Jason read.

72
00:04:08.934 --> 00:04:11.795
"Write five things you're thankful for."

73
00:04:11.815 --> 00:04:14.376
"Easy," Ethan said.

74
00:04:14.396 --> 00:04:17.016
"I'm thankful for Bobby's cookies!"

75
00:04:18.577 --> 00:04:21.998
After everyone wrote their five things, Nina read the next step.

76
00:04:22.018 --> 00:04:25.799
"Put the painted plate on top of the white plate.

77
00:04:26.719 --> 00:04:29.980
Connect them loosely with a brass paper fastener."

78
00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.441
"Now spin!"

79
00:04:32.861 --> 00:04:33.501
Izzie said.

80
00:04:34.722 --> 00:04:36.063
Everyone spun their plates.

81
00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:41.766
"I want to show you guys what I'm thankful for," Bobby said.

82
00:04:43.346 --> 00:04:49.930
Slowly he showed his five things Izzie, Nina, Ethan, Jason, and Miss Shelly.

83
00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:52.471
"Thank you, Bobby!"

84
00:04:52.871 --> 00:04:53.772
his friends said.
